# Enforce LF line endings repo-wide.
#
# Many CSD Foundry artifacts are content-addressed by SHA-256 (seed JSONL,
# v0.4 execution/publication/reconciliation schemas and fixtures, v0.5 frozen
# contracts). A contributor's `core.autocrlf=true` (the historical default on
# Windows) silently rewrites LF -> CRLF on checkout, which invalidates every
# frozen digest. Pin every text file to LF so the working-tree bytes match
# the committed bytes on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artifacts must never be touched by any EOL or text filter.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.gz   binary
